sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor personA as Person A
    participant walletA as Wallet A / Dock A
    participant vault as Note vault / wallet N
    participant billA as Bill A
    participant billB as Bill B
    participant walletB as Wallet B / Dock B
    participant chain as Mutinynet

    rect rgb(220, 252, 231)
        walletA->>vault: Prepare fresh transport-free invoice and immutable plan
        vault-->>personA: Show exact 5 USDT funding plan
        personA->>vault: CONFIRM fresh plan id
        walletA->>chain: RGB funding transaction A to N
        vault->>chain: Refresh exact receive to SETTLED
        vault->>billA: Load canonical 603-byte bearer capsule
    end

    rect rgb(239, 246, 255)
        Note over billA,billB: Docks and Internet may be unavailable
        personA->>billB: Press empty receiver once
        billA-->>billB: BLE kind 04 chunks with ACK and CRC32
        billB->>billB: Atomically promote bearer-held
        billB->>billB: Reboot and restore same metadata
    end

    rect rgb(254, 249, 195)
        billB-->>walletB: Extract exact capsule through dock CHUNK_OUT
        walletB->>walletB: Persist privately and verify source SHA-256
        walletB->>vault: Fresh Wallet B invoice and claim capability
        vault-->>personA: Show immutable redemption plan
        personA->>vault: CONFIRM fresh redemption plan id
        vault->>chain: RGB redemption transaction N to B
        vault-->>walletB: Exact retained OOB consignment
    end

    rect rgb(220, 252, 231)
        walletB->>walletB: Import exact consignment
        walletB->>chain: Refresh one matching receive_witness
        chain-->>walletB: Confirmed anchor
        walletB->>walletB: Verify 5,000,000 assignment and balance delta
        walletB-->>personA: REDEEMED | claim SPENT | no resend
    end

    Note over walletA,walletB: Exactly two RGB transitions<br/>The offline BLE hop moves a bearer capability
    Note over vault,walletB: Trusted-vault Mutinynet prototype<br/>A copied capsule is first-redemption-wins
